{
  "title": "Oozy Earthy Peruvian Bean Sprouts Papa Rellena",
  "description": "A lazy Sunday Peruvian dish featuring bean sprouts, fold, and earthy flavors, made with ayurvedic-tamasic-friendly ingredients. This papa rellena is a delicious and satisfying meal.",
  "cuisine": "Peruvian",
